能的速度持开放态度"&gt;放慢速度&lt;/a&gt;，并希望其他人也能效仿。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style="margin-top: 24px; padding-inline-start: 24px;"&gt;&lt;li style="font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 16px;"&gt;一位前人类研究人员本周发出&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;公开警告&lt;/strong&gt;，声称人工智能竞赛“可能会在本世纪末杀死我们所有人”， &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/9H3nap_o0VylA8y0kv-yGDsP38glbRUUj8TP5IkTJVMLYi-g0NsSAA5sSdy2bYNW5GW0cNgnQ3awOVSUI3dG7ltJpUtig7MvzyfeBTDXwfYmpBee_0jZADvfF4glDd6FFLyLB78-dPq1izAK5OkAjch5g9-r_2R5_wCwB4zxjpjvKis-fcUT1IuOyYqmX9dngjmw5pUteEmwiJQnDt4_psPsP97l1MBMHQ6qzvGMlfz4xwFw3CRo6pCA0EbqNbeO7PVZjt1C4fO37wTe_P1AIvrQIRxjjH4jpPbhC2gTFErtCQ2MryFeBdiFExGv7ojICBbIFrI2b51XcI3uaM5wJIKsvkfJIF0VKSPNekdcntpUj2PbYgZ_hKowwPMvF2oDnlro29KQaM6b5QULKXM4LGurELsC4G2cALSDOuA1Eq5QwR12lER0aC6AfWXvkEGOcdA_EYPCG1gdZGVviaKiTjpYIFlBbz6Q8mcTo7u8weBEfoQC4kVXUpbIIEMTJ8gtv5lLaB9bPOmAhdOGjdgDjXatrniHe1UxX0sDvnNWlxAgzlM9oZo/R0di9SUNrt3Wc_0vjTaleFyfrNM59QXN/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #00e; font-size: 16px;" target="_blank" title="人类工人因人工智能公司“拿我们的生命赌博”而辞职"&gt;这更是火上浇油&lt;/a&gt;。 OpenAI 的一位科学家还警告说，世界&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/n2Ko5FJUTbUpLAo5FrDB0oRWxFoBNheLrzC3MSIhUrjCKKYe0KiSHNCPY6dHZJQ5AYMX_8-NHkJ2BNgkJjh9j-ezIUK5NZ8Tfie7B6h31pSacWY4nvMlKJ434b0F4p-4Y8oNsCHVoeJoI4lefR2xwbnnJJz2XzO_Xi7HdMtDJK8JHLtFJW0wz9uwv6QWKNB3L-wT_58zVzsO3qr3FjMS49qXlx1qdEcggXBZyE9Z1zQpvs8IbviL-Q9lnzIOLre1o7r2kUn7Erf-ytXh5hShP8Bkrr1NrgRwBpaf54tKdfAChgx2yDLNylS7zUTihEiyvT7ch1dseY3RsdRnVRBkPlEg1-y6eAJQ5fnhLFFwULSth-HYH5irDWeBVO_I0Rv3DC_HgVAsOr7v3-u4yBPqm_cCCZLsWksFC5cVIGYeBKWabn8v1tsI--4z9KMo6jpHhQGDJmK0eVD4HymJR4yc5EBKUFt__n6hpe5j-E3Gx_nU1HfaQk9hJZ-aC_qLmue7eb_PzLQ53qL-KUsbajXYQ02MPtZAGbTIIl6oONcEsZboHRFR494/aMpHCA2d6gNX0dTW7y5fPPyLCr7EgKf9/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #00e; font-size: 16px;" target="_blank" title="OpenAI 顶级科学家敦促对人工智能的发展“极度谨慎”"&gt;对人工智能的快速崛起还没有做好准备&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.4; fon